  "author": "Edgar Zanella Alvarenga",
  "type": "module",
  "description": "Loading, execution & trust (WP2): DirectHost runner, makeCtx + capability mediation, and the untrusted runners — the browser realm (./realm) and the QuickJS-WASM isolate (./isolate, the fallback).",
